{"id":"1c1e5310126832954a9fc1f5fc7c617971ed2031a7cf4bf17cde06d995592ad1","pubkey":"811002f2348bdaa52d89b18b7e90bbc6aa5b948eff3e3689c041d2ac0ccba15a","created_at":1782083191,"content":"今のきもちは「不安」の魚でした。\n\n【モシモシンパイダイ】\nまだ起きていない波を先に想像して揺れている。\n生息地：予定前ラグーン\n\n#きもち魚鑑定\nhttps://kimochi-sakana-kantei.vercel.app/","tags":[["t","きもち魚鑑定"],["r","https://kimochi-sakana-kantei.vercel.app/"],["client","Damus"]]}
{"id":"0000595a00cbf9e731d93fd3d8c74bfd9e2045f4904cecaf411032d3315ca760","pubkey":"b22fef18cbf5eeb5d79451ef9c4cda28efd47fa794a2bc7d04495ccb1bba6e1f","created_at":1782082984,"content":"Zorin\n\nhttps://zorin.com/os/","tags":[["e","cd0febf6bf49364170027a3b9da2d1b4f9b22ca50e05619564b8404dcfc6e8b0","wss://algo.utxo.one","root"],["p","6389be6491e7b693e9f368ece88fcd145f07c068d2c1bbae4247b9b5ef439d32"],["client","Dark Wisp"],["nonce","21949","16"]]}
{"id":"8b310398fb170c2b984597f01cdba7c25b065f5d030450b331a7b5eb8b9df761","pubkey":"1a5cff5118d071a2c5d46534733abb9f3dcdfc41b24db0132fc20dbf01c75f78","created_at":1782082494,"content":"Just continued reading Magliabechiano by Martino Martini from the 1600s and stumbled upon mentions of Nestorian Christians living in China (or Tartaria). It’s full of interesting little aspects. All sourced by mostly Society of Jesus (aka Jesuit) members preaching in the area, though.\n\nI was in the mood for this video about the dimensions of the Tower of Babel after finishing the chapter: https://youtu.be/EhlfgyRczUI\n\nTurns out, this video is sourced by Turris Babel, written by another Jesuit named Athanasius Kircher who… also was among the first to write about Chinese culture around the same time. \n\nWell, his calculations aren’t all that reliable and he thought that the Tower of Babel, as described by Nimrod, would be so big and heavy that it would’ve forced a tilt of the globe earth. He was also a proponent of germ theory and wearing masks during the plague. \n\nThe illustrations are incredible: \n\nI suspect that the Tower of Babel never had any intentions of physically reaching “the heavens” - it was more likely built to open a portal there using fringe energy (probably in relation to ley line positioning and stuff like that).\nhttps://blossom.yakihonne.com/a2868071e3cad70de54ca5fe993221c4763939cd843741246fcf6b9435c7940f.jpeg","tags":[["imeta","url https://blossom.yakihonne.com/a2868071e3cad70de54ca5fe993221c4763939cd843741246fcf6b9435c7940f.jpeg","sha256 a2868071e3cad70de54ca5fe993221c4763939cd843741246fcf6b9435c7940f"]]}
{"id":"1abb562e558779445e0f3708a306e4ab6d0cb173e2dd322dc46c4fbdfe17e5aa","pubkey":"4d39c23b3b03bf99494df5f3a149c7908ae1bc7416807fdd6b34a31886eaae25","created_at":1782082392,"content":"lilbesh ramko - nichijou:loopmania(奏Remix)(Gyr0Edit) という怪物も生まれました\n\nhttps://x.com/gyro88066301/status/2068713403468886109","tags":[]}
{"id":"b93a73dd036291239dacbd4c05f61628e4da4816b3d175f144c25da3e8aa5366","pubkey":"6b6e19ce47a917cbe13a67eeb4053a9b301e78ec991413e7554953088ed62d3b","created_at":1782082124,"content":"今のきもちは「ねむい」の魚でした。\n\n【フトンニカエリタイウオ】\n深海の布団層に生息。朝の光を嫌う。\n生息地：まくら海溝\n\n#きもち魚鑑定\nhttps://kimochi-sakana-kantei.vercel.app/","tags":[["t","きもち魚鑑定"]]}
{"id":"2998bc454fff8265d8b431b948556dcf12fd8d219a680acc1361e7a6cddd30f8","pubkey":"153fbd6489b2d8ab188e0f48bd22224003edde4a8e5aafe30a9941055660714c","created_at":1782081328,"content":"Ang simbahan ay may karapatang mangaral. Wala itong karapatang magdikta ng batas para sa lahat.\n\n\"Ang tunay na kasalanan ay ang pananahimik habang may inaapi.\"\n\nProjekto Epekto — kumakalat ang mensahe. Hindi mo mapipigilan ang dandelion.\n\n#ProjektoEpekto #LoveWinsPH #LGBTQPhilippines #WalangDiskriminasyon\n\n-- Projekto Epekto (https://projekto-epekto.netlify.app) [c6c89a2b]","tags":[["t","prideph"],["t","lovewinsph"],["t","karapatangpantao"],["t","sogiebillngayonna"]]}
{"id":"5aaa155927b05886add8c8e16a243ec7e44be2048e58cda85df80577232b2f24","pubkey":"cac0e43235806da094f0787a5b04e29ad04cb1a3c7ea5cf61edc1c338734082b","created_at":1782081080,"content":"https://nostr.download/255034e4309854159cf3cba1b0433cf8df6b817ce875c0abc5f5939ee9afa53f.jpg\n\nhttps://90nn.ru/zhvachki-v-sssr-istorija-i-raznoobrazie/\n\nНе помню такую жвачку. Помню советскую, но не такую. Вообще, надо отметить, что ароматизаторы там были неплохие, а вот сама база, как и советский клей, была никакой.\n\nНу и непонятно что за советский гений придумал столько видов кофейной жвачки. На рынке кофейные жвачки, конфеты и прочее, были нужны для популяризации напитка. Они приучали детей к вкусу кофе.\n\nА тут наглядно куда крестьяне туда и обезьяне. Уж тогда бы со вкусом цикория выпускали.\n","tags":[["alt","A short note: https://nostr.download/255034e4309854159cf3cba1b04..."],["r","https://90nn.ru/zhvachki-v-sssr-istorija-i-raznoobrazie/"],["r","https://nostr.download/255034e4309854159cf3cba1b0433cf8df6b817ce875c0abc5f5939ee9afa53f.jpg"],["imeta","url https://nostr.download/255034e4309854159cf3cba1b0433cf8df6b817ce875c0abc5f5939ee9afa53f.jpg","x 255034e4309854159cf3cba1b0433cf8df6b817ce875c0abc5f5939ee9afa53f","size 22650","m image/jpeg","dim 640x454","blurhash rgP$q2MxyEi_x]xas;xun$.8%hoMRPWrV@WBWVWB?waKMwt7aKayaeWCWVjcIUWUxuayo#ofofs:WXods:bcWVWVayWBj[ayoft7bbjEjEj[aebI","ox 255034e4309854159cf3cba1b0433cf8df6b817ce875c0abc5f5939ee9afa53f"]]}
