{"id":"b4ce7f2178c2eeb591e09edcfbd61717a1f58954fd0a7f3cce4d0234d9ceed08","pubkey":"af5aa898e8d13b6aef7a9f5a5e6f7e40c0fc5ae9ac3cf8301574e894488e4973","created_at":1782079962,"content":"I’ve recently opened my mind to BIP 110 for the sake of trying to hear where supporters for it are coming from, as I believe many of them care about Bitcoin as much as I do.\n\nI get some of the arguments, but what I can’t wrap my head around are notions like the one below.\n\nAre BIP 110 supporters okay with getting rid of Bitcoin’s PoW algorithm?\n\nI’m asking this out of genuine curiosity, not trolling.\nhttps://i.nostr.build/Q0FxRArSTHALicCX.jpg","tags":[]}
