{"id":"638f8d2bcc636d9486d3724c69c3a2b0ac9c690dbbd80ec71daeeb968226fa09","pubkey":"a1fc5dfd7ffcf563c89155b466751b580d115e136e2f8c90e8913385bbedb1cf","created_at":1782051768,"content":"Nat Burnell who I love made this post on X, here is my response to it.  I defy anyone to prove me wrong.  😂 \n\nBecause half of all BTC people are autistic & OCD and the other half have Asperger's. Apies can accept reality the Autists can't.  \n\nThis leads to rage by the Autists against @saylor & anyone or any entity that does anything other than just HODL & spend BTC.  And they must do so exactly as the Autists demand.  The Aspies think this is subtarded and point that out.  \n\nThe rage than grows and the cycle is repeated, over and over. \n\nThank you for coming to my Ted-X Talk.  🖐️🎤 \n\n https://blossom.primal.net/3bf953154b9cfb258fb2e9a5ed92f6e41f61a60012ef47db92d54d38dba41238.png ","tags":[["r","wss://nostr.bitcoiner.social/"],["r","wss://groups.0xchat.com/"],["r","wss://nostr.wine/"],["r","wss://relay.damus.io/"],["r","wss://nos.lol/"],["r","wss://eden.nostr.land/"],["r","wss://relay.primal.net/"],["r","wss://yabu.me/"],["r","wss://relay.0xchat.com/"],["r","wss://relay.snort.social/"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/3bf953154b9cfb258fb2e9a5ed92f6e41f61a60012ef47db92d54d38dba41238.png","m image/png","dim 1246x1356","service nip96"],["client","Primal Web"]]}
